    "compare.html": {
      "title": "Visual Design Comparison — Catalogue Archetype",
      "lang": "en",
      "strings": [
        "Visual design reference comparison",
        "Each reference board from",
        "../",
        "beside the live page it informed, rendered in an iframe at a 1280 × 900 desktop viewport and a 390 × 844 mobile viewport.",
        "The boards are the three JPEGs committed alongside this demo. Per",
        "../README.md",
        "they are \"visual planning references, neither generated-site captures nor sealed evaluation targets\", and their products, prices, stock counts, totals and checkout buttons are \"illustrative, unverified placeholders\" that \"do not prove a functional search, cart, checkout, responsive implementation or accessible controls\".",
        "Nothing on this page is a screenshot: the right-hand frames are the live files in this directory, loaded in an iframe, so no capture is committed and none can drift from the implementation. The left-hand images are the boards themselves, unmodified.",
        "Comparison page only. It asserts no match with the boards and no conformance result; the contract's server routes are not implemented by this demo. Read",
        "README.md",
        "for what it does and does not do."
      ],
